// The museum's fictional online world: what the TVs' servers would have sent. The firmware gets apps,
// films, games and recommendations from Samsung's servers, which the museum cannot reach, so both
// exhibits use this one stub catalogue. Everything here is invented (the broadcasters reuse the names of
// the fictional channel lineup in src/tv/channels.ts); artwork is generated by stubArt() rather than
// drawn, so it reads as a placeholder. Videos reuse the stand-in loops in public/video.

